{
  "_comment": "Fiat 500e / Abarth 500e (2020+ new platform, Stellantis). Derived from Car Scanner adapter logs 2026-07-13 and 2026-08-18 (VIN ZFAEFA265R...), see fiat500e-2020-decoded-pids.md. Bus: ISO 15765-4 CAN 29-bit 500k (ATSP7, ATCP18). Byte indices follow WiCAN's raw-frame convention (B0 = first ISO-TP PCI byte, continuation-frame PCI bytes count too) — verified against HA's recorded soc_real. The earlier guess that 0x42 DID 019E was the displayed SoC was WRONG (it reads ~85 and barely moves while BMS SoC changes); SoC comes from BPCM 0x44 22A010. NOTE: polling keeps the car awake (DC-DC on, HV drain) — poll sparsely when not charging.",
